@SupriyaShrinate In 2009, the crude in INR was around 3000 Rs per barrel. Cost of Petrol per ltr including subsidy/underrecovery was between Rs 55-Rs 60.
Come to 2026, crude in INR is Rs 10000 per barrel (more than 3 times that of 2009). Cost of petrol per ltr Rs 100.
Who was looting Indians?

